# Linguist overrides — ensure Python is detected as primary language
# CSS remains counted after trimming (now ~8kB vs Python ~16kB), but we mark
# it vendored as a safety net so future CSS growth never flips the primary
# language back to CSS. Comment out if you want CSS counted again.
public/style.css linguist-vendored
public/script.js linguist-vendored
# Keep HTML counted (small) — not vendored
